2. ŋuruš šag₄-ga-ni er₂ im-si edin-še₃ ba-ra-e₃
#tr.en: The lad's heart was full of tears as he went out into the countryside.
#lem: ŋuruš[young adult male]; šag[heart]; er[tears]; si[fill]; eden[plain]; e[leave]
#etcsl: line-id=2

3. {d}dumu-zid šag₄-ga-ni er₂ im-si edin-še₃ ba-ra-e₃
#tr.en: @wDN{Dumuzid's} heart was full of tears as he went out into the countryside.
