#etcsl: line-id=3

4. ŋidru (1::1) gu₂-na mu-un-di-la₂ i-lu mu-un-du-du
#tr.en: He carried with him his @vart[t143.v1,t143.v1]{@varn{1 ms. adds:} shepherd's } stick on his shoulder, sobbing all the time:
